{"id":"nevoeiro","lemma":"nevoeiro","pos":"noun","rank":3830,"glosses":["fog, haze, mist"],"ipa":"/nɨˈvwɐj.ɾu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"nevoeiros"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f0/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Ed_Guimaraes-nevoeiro.wav","examples":[{"text":"O nevoeiro está aumentando.","en":"The fog is getting thicker.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1271394","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"to increase","l":"aumentar"}]},{"text":"O denso nevoeiro encobriu tudo.","en":"The thick fog blotted out everything.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"dense, thick"},null,{"g":"to hide","l":"encobrir"},{"g":"everything"}]},{"text":"O nevoeiro impediu que os aviões decolassem.","en":"The fog prevented the planes from taking off.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/841065","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to prevent","l":"impedir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"airplane, aeroplane","l":"avião"},null]},{"text":"O nevoeiro limitou a visibilidade a 100 metros.","en":"Fog has limited visibility to 100 meters.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to limit","l":"limitar"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"visibility"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"metre","l":"metro"}]},{"text":"O trem de carga ficou retido cerca de meia hora por causa de um denso nevoeiro.","en":"The freight train was held up about half an hour because of a dense fog.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"set"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"charge"},{"g":"to become","l":"ficar"},{"g":"to retain, hold","l":"reter"},null,null,null,null,null,null,null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"dense, thick"},null],"phrases":[[6,8,"about"],[8,10,"half-hour"],[10,13,"because of"]]}]}